<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ An Agentic Toolkit for Adaptive Information Extraction from Regulatory Documents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Agentic System Evaluation Related Details</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
