<section id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Value Similarity.</h5>

<div id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, we assess the similarity of extracted values by comparing model outputs to the annotated ground truth. This evaluation is computed only for outputs that match the expected key structure, with a score of 0 automatically assigned to those that do not. We report three complementary metrics: Exact Match, BLEU, and ROUGE (see Appendix <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Agentic System Evaluation Related Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ An Agentic Toolkit for Adaptive Information Extraction from Regulatory Documents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> for details).</p>
</div>
