              <span id="algorithm3.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 2: Flatten Nested Key Paths</span> ;  <span id="algorithm3.4.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm3.4.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Convert JSON tree to flat path-value pairs</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm3.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
              <math id="algorithm3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{\text{pred}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{\text{pred}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Flattened key-value pairs from <math id="algorithm3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{d,\ell}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{d,\ell}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> with paths prefixed by <math id="algorithm3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> ;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm3.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
              <math id="algorithm3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{\text{gt}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mtext>gt</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{\text{gt}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Flattened key-value pairs from <math id="algorithm3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}_{d,\ell}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}_{d,\ell}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> with paths prefixed by <math id="algorithm3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> ;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm3.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
              <span id="algorithm3.4.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3: Align Key Paths and Initialize Scores</span>
<math id="algorithm3.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{d,\ell}^{k}\leftarrow\{p\in\text{keys}(V^{\text{gt}})\cap\text{keys}(V^{\text{pred}})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>keys</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mtext>gt</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mtext>keys</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{d,\ell}^{k}\leftarrow\{p\in\text{keys}(V^{\text{gt}})\cap\text{keys}(V^{\text{pred}})\}</annotation></semantics></math> ;
</div>
